<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Description">Description</span></h2>
<p><b>This is for character creation only.</b>
</p><p>Do not ever call outside of character generation, it will destroy a player's character.
</p><p>NOTE: item abilities will not be cleared. To clear an item ability, the item that added it must be removed.
</p>
